      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN PULSE (1) still a maiden but rarely out of the finish recording six placings from seven starts. Was below best last time when missed the frame finishing second (23.38) at this track. Capable of going well again. SMART DIRECTION (8) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (23.90) last time in a Maiden at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Worth another chance. CHRONIC DIANA (2) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when third beaten 4.5 lengths (23.70). Yet to win here but has placed two times. Likely to be in the finish again. ALL ABOUT ARLO (7) has been in the frame at his last two runs, most recently when third (22.86) in a Maiden over 400m at Maitland. Something for the Multiples: MYSTERY ACE (5)",
